## Responsibilities

| Component | Responsibility |
| --- | --- |
| `main.py` | Compose the FastAPI application and register routers |
| `router.py` and `dependencies.py` | Handle HTTP and request-scoped concerns |
| `schemas.py` | Define and validate API inputs and outputs |
| `service.py` | Coordinate business rules and use cases |
| `models.py` | Define persistence models when needed |

Add files only when needed. A domain can import another domain explicitly;
avoid circular imports. Keep request handling in routers, business logic in
services, and database access in domain persistence code. Do not introduce
generic layers or abstractions without a concrete need.

Register each top-level domain package in `harness.yaml`.
`fastapi-harness check` verifies package registration, complexity, types and
style, not the responsibilities or relationships of domain modules.
